{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15360410","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15360410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1536041001:0":{"text":"아쿠보르를 비추는 은빛 달이 강물처럼 흘러 모든 영혼을 받쳐 올리리라.","source_cn":"银色的月光将会落下，照耀着雅库伯尔。河流一般流淌，托起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C8EEF8DF1B3AC3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1536041002:0":{"text":"고통받은 영혼, 슬픔에 빠진 영혼, 숲에서 죽은 영혼, 타향에서 죽은 영혼.","source_cn":"痛苦的魂灵，悲伤的魂灵。死在丛林的魂灵，死在他乡的魂灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58A2769825584639","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1536041003:0":{"text":"모든 영혼, 모든 사람, 모든 아쿠보르의 아이들이 그 평온한 꿈에 빠지리라.","source_cn":"所有的魂灵，所有的人，所有雅库伯尔的孩子，都将沉入那安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x141C806401369920","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1536041004:0":{"text":"함께 진심을 담아 <style=\"highlight\">기도</style>하라! 너희의 부름과 그리움이 모든 떠도는 영혼을 인도하리라.","source_cn":"一同真诚地<style=highlight>祷告</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF565E45D6D826157","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1536041005:0":{"text":"그리고 모든 영혼은 반드시 돌아와 숲의 나무들 속에서 안식을 얻으리라.","source_cn":"而后，那一切的魂灵必将回归，在群树中得到安宁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C726E28EF54D288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_inde